description:
This program is supposed to find and print the maximum value in an array that contains negative numbers (expected output: 15), but it prints 0. Find the bugs and rebuild the corrected program.
```
public class FindMax {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] numbers = {-5, -2, 15, 3, 8};
        int max = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < numbers.length; i++) {
            if (numbers[i] < max) {
                max = numbers[i];
            }
        }
        System.out.println(max);
    }
}
```
